<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH CBANK SETS ONE-WEEK REPO TENDER AT MAX 75PCT.</title>
<headline>CZECH CBANK SETS ONE-WEEK REPO TENDER AT MAX 75PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech central bank (CNB) on Monday set a one-week repo tender to drain funds from the market at a maximum limit of 75 percent, unchanged from Friday's maximum rate.</p>
</text>
